        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 3024-7, 7 Inch Box Clamp Type Double Acting Spring Hinge </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n7\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. Box clamp type door flange is attached to door with thru-bolts and nuts. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. Available for doors 1-3/8\" , 1-1/2\", 1-5/8\" thick. Packaged with all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/7-inch-box-clamp-type-double-acting-spring-hinge-with-ball-tips-pair-bommer-cl3024-7\">Bommer CL3024-7 7\" Double Acting Spring Hinge with Ball Tips</a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer 3024-7 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Template</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Optional 1-3/8\" , 1-1/2\", 1-5/8\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3024-7.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 3024-7 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 3024-7 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\" bgcolor=\"#eeeeee\">\r\n<td>3024-7</td>\r\n<td>82 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>120 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>1-3/8\", 1-1/2\", 1-5/8\"</td>\r\n<td>7'-0\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> Doorbox clamps are not adjustable. \r\n  <br>** These hinges are normally special order 3-5 weeks to ship. Select the thickness of your door below. </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Bommer 3024-7 available for 3 different Door Thickness</b>\r\n<li>Bommer 3024-7-1.375: 1-3/8\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Bommer 3024-7-1.500: 1-1/2\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Bommer 3024-7-1.625: 1-5/8\" Thick Door</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b></p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<br><b>** These hinges are normally special order 3-5 weeks to ship. Select the thickness of your door below. </b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><b>** This item is Discontinued </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
